abstract: >-
  MobiOrigin is a CPU-oriented sequence-and-marker classifier that assigns
  bacterial DNA fragments to chromosome, plasmid, phage, or an explicit
  unclassified state. Version 0.1.6 retains the exact frozen three-seed dev1
  model and scientific decision rules while adding compressed FASTA input,
  actionable runtime diagnostics, live workflow progress, expanded normalized
  annotation reporting, and origin-stratified evidence visualizations.
